# Pavilion agent home (critical)

This Cursor workspace is **`pavilion`** (`auraflux-dev/pavilion`). Agents stay here for **Pavilion / Commons only**.

Pavilion ships **one** Commons app (`commons-pto-demo`). Brand packs skin prospects. See `commons-one-surface.mdc`.

## Canonical product source

**`auraflux-dev/shmspto`** (`~/shmspto`) is the **source of truth** for shared PTO product (Staff, portal, checkout, Cove).

Pavilion is a **downstream consumer**. It does **not** lead product development and does **not** auto-sync after every SHMS ship.

| Work | Where |
|------|--------|
| Stone Hill visitor, portal, staff, shared product | **`~/shmspto`** — use that workspace |
| Pavilion-only (demo flags, brand packs, CRM, trial, `commons-site`) | **`pavilion`** (this repo) |
| Pull SHMS product into demo | **Only when Rob asks** — see sync below |

## Vercel wall (never mix)

| Account | Use for |
|---------|---------|
| **robert-4220s-projects** | Pavilion only: `commons-pto-demo`, `commons-pto`, `commons-site` |
| **treasurer-4353s-projects** | Stone Hill www only, via **git push** on `~/shmspto`. **Never** `vercel link` / `vercel deploy` from this monorepo |

If `vercel whoami` / MCP only shows treasurer, **stop**. Do not link or deploy. Ask Rob to switch to robert-4220 for Pavilion deploys.

Local `.vercel/project.json` under this repo must **not** point at treasurer. If it does, delete it.

## Product sync (Rob-initiated only, one direction)

Sync **only when Rob explicitly asks** (e.g. “sync demo from school”, “pull shms into pavilion”).

```bash
node scripts/sync-product-between-repos.mjs --from-shms --dry-run
node scripts/sync-product-between-repos.mjs --from-shms --apply
# then commit pavilion + deploy commons-pto-demo if Rob wants demo live
```

**Do not** run `--from-shms` or deploy Pavilion after a Stone Hill ship unless Rob asked.

**Do not** run `--to-shms` unless Rob explicitly asks to port Pavilion-only work into school (rare). Default product path is edit in `~/shmspto`, not pavilion → shms.

Drift check (informational): `node scripts/shms-frontend-parity.mjs` — “only in shmspto” is expected until Rob requests a sync.

Stone Hill production = **git push** `auraflux-dev/shmspto` `main`. Treasurer auto-deploys. Agents do not need the treasurer Vercel login from this workspace.

## Anti-patterns (forbidden)

- Editing shared Staff / portal / checkout product in `pavilion/frontend` as the primary path
- Auto-syncing or auto-deploying Pavilion after every SHMS ship
- `--to-shms` without Rob asking
- `vercel link` / Stone Hill deploy from this repo
